@startuml C1_Incident_Types_Logical_View
title C1 – Incident Types Management (Context View)

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator
cloud "Identity Provider\n(OAuth2/OIDC)" as IAM

rectangle "Frontoffice SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "Incident Types UI" as UI
}

rectangle "TodoApi" as Gateway
cloud "OEM Operational Execution Service" as OEM

database "OEM Operational Store" as Db

Operator --> UI : Browser (HTTPS)
UI --> Gateway : REST (list/create/update/delete)
Gateway --> IAM : Validate session
Gateway --> OEM : /incident-types (proxied)
OEM --> Db : Query / persist incident types
Db --> OEM : Result / updated entity
OEM --> Gateway : JSON responses
Gateway --> UI : Forward response

@enduml
